{
  "__inputs": [{"name":"DS_VICTORIAMETRICS","label":"VictoriaMetrics","type":"datasource","pluginId":"prometheus"}],
  "__requires": [
    {"type":"grafana","id":"grafana","name":"Grafana","version":"12.0.0"},
    {"type":"datasource","id":"prometheus","name":"Prometheus","version":"1.0.0"},
    {"type":"panel","id":"stat","name":"Stat","version":""},
    {"type":"panel","id":"timeseries","name":"Time series","version":""},
    {"type":"panel","id":"bargauge","name":"Bar gauge","version":""},
    {"type":"panel","id":"text","name":"Text","version":""}
  ],
  "uid": "copilot-otel-token-economics",
  "title": "Copilot — Token Usage and Model Economics",
  "description": "Enterprise-wide token consumption by model from VS OTel instrumentation. Shows which models are most token-intensive and how token usage trends over time.",
  "tags": ["copilot","otel","tokens","model","economics"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1h",
  "time": {"from": "now-28d", "to": "now"},
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "templating": {"list": [
    {
      "name": "service",
      "type": "query",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "query": "label_values(gen_ai_client_token_usage_count, service_name)",
      "refresh": 2,
      "multi": true,
      "includeAll": true,
      "allValue": ".*",
      "label": "Service",
      "current": {}
    },
    {
      "name": "model",
      "type": "query",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "query": "label_values(gen_ai_client_token_usage_count{service_name=~\"$service\"}, gen_ai_request_model)",
      "refresh": 2,
      "multi": true,
      "includeAll": true,
      "allValue": ".*",
      "label": "Model",
      "current": {}
    }
  ]},
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1, "type": "text", "title": "About This Dashboard",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "## Copilot Token Usage and Model Economics\n\nEnterprise-wide token consumption sourced from Visual Studio OTel instrumentation flowing into VictoriaMetrics. These metrics are emitted directly by the Copilot client and reflect actual LLM token usage — the underlying driver of AI credit spend.\n\n**Key concepts**\n- **Input tokens** — tokens sent to the model (your prompt + context). These drive the majority of cost on most models.\n- **Output tokens** — tokens generated by the model (the response). Generally cheaper per token than input.\n- **Token type** is available via the `gen_ai.token.type` label: `input` or `output`.\n- **Service** filter distinguishes `copilot-chat` (chat panel, agent mode) from `github-copilot` (completions).\n\n**Note:** These metrics have no user_login label — they represent enterprise totals. User-level token attribution requires MDM deployment of `OTEL_RESOURCE_ATTRIBUTES=user.username=<github-handle>` to Visual Studio machines.\n\n**Metric names in VictoriaMetrics:** OTel dots are converted to underscores — `gen_ai.client.token.usage_sum` becomes `gen_ai_client_token_usage_sum`."}
    },
    {
      "id": 100, "type": "row", "title": "Token Summary",
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5}, "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 2, "type": "stat", "title": "Total Input Tokens",
      "description": "Total input tokens sent to all models across the enterprise in the selected window. Input tokens represent the prompt and context sent to the LLM. Source: gen_ai_client_token_usage_sum filtered to token_type=input.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 6},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "sum(increase(gen_ai_client_token_usage_sum{service_name=~\"$service\", gen_ai_token_type=\"input\"}[$__range]))", "legendFormat": "Input Tokens", "refId": "A"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"color": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#3B82E6"}, "unit": "locale", "decimals": 0}},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name"}
    },
    {
      "id": 3, "type": "stat", "title": "Total Output Tokens",
      "description": "Total output tokens generated by all models across the enterprise in the selected window. Output tokens are the model responses returned to developers. Source: gen_ai_client_token_usage_sum filtered to token_type=output.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 6},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "sum(increase(gen_ai_client_token_usage_sum{service_name=~\"$service\", gen_ai_token_type=\"output\"}[$__range]))", "legendFormat": "Output Tokens", "refId": "A"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"color": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#5BA85B"}, "unit": "locale", "decimals": 0}},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name"}
    },
    {
      "id": 4, "type": "stat", "title": "Total Operations",
      "description": "Total number of LLM operations (prompts sent to model) across the enterprise in the selected window. Each operation is one prompt-response cycle. Source: gen_ai_client_operation_duration_count.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 6},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "sum(increase(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_count{service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__range]))", "legendFormat": "Operations", "refId": "A"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"color": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#9C5FE0"}, "unit": "locale", "decimals": 0}},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name"}
    },
    {
      "id": 5, "type": "stat", "title": "Avg Tokens per Operation",
      "description": "Average total tokens (input + output) per LLM operation across the enterprise. Rising values indicate increasingly complex prompts or longer responses. Source: total token usage sum divided by operation count.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 6},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "sum(increase(gen_ai_client_token_usage_sum{service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__range])) / clamp_min(sum(increase(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_count{service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__range])), 1)", "legendFormat": "Avg Tokens/Op", "refId": "A"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"color": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#F0954A"}, "unit": "locale", "decimals": 1}},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name"}
    },
    {
      "id": 101, "type": "row", "title": "Token Trends Over Time",
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 10}, "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 6, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Daily Token Consumption — Input vs Output",
      "description": "Daily input and output token consumption across the enterprise. Input tokens dominate cost on most models. A growing ratio of output to input may indicate developers are getting more verbose responses — review whether response length is appropriate for the task.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 11},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "sum(increase(gen_ai_client_token_usage_sum{service_name=~\"$service\", gen_ai_token_type=\"input\"}[1d]))", "legendFormat": "Input Tokens", "refId": "A"},
        {"expr": "sum(increase(gen_ai_client_token_usage_sum{service_name=~\"$service\", gen_ai_token_type=\"output\"}[1d]))", "legendFormat": "Output Tokens", "refId": "B"}
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"unit": "locale", "custom": {"fillOpacity": 75, "lineWidth": 2}},
        "overrides": [
          {"matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "Input Tokens"}, "properties": [{"id": "color", "value": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#3B82E6"}}]},
          {"matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "Output Tokens"}, "properties": [{"id": "color", "value": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#5BA85B"}}]}
        ]
      },
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom"}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 7, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Daily Token Consumption by Service",
      "description": "Token consumption split between copilot-chat (chat panel and agent mode) and github-copilot (inline completions). Shows which surface is driving the most token usage over time.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 20},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "sum by (service_name) (increase(gen_ai_client_token_usage_sum[1d]))", "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}", "refId": "A"}
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "locale", "custom": {"fillOpacity": 75, "lineWidth": 2}}},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom"}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 8, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Average Tokens per Operation Over Time",
      "description": "Rolling average of tokens per LLM operation each day. A rising trend indicates increasingly complex prompts or context windows. A falling trend may indicate developers are writing more concise prompts or switching to lighter tasks.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 20},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "sum(rate(gen_ai_client_token_usage_sum{service_name=~\"$service\"}[1d])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_count{service_name=~\"$service\"}[1d])), 0.001)", "legendFormat": "Avg Tokens/Operation", "refId": "A"}
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "locale", "decimals": 1, "color": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#F0954A"}, "custom": {"fillOpacity": 75, "lineWidth": 2}}},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom"}, "tooltip": {"mode": "single"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 102, "type": "row", "title": "Token Usage by Model",
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 29}, "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 9, "type": "bargauge", "title": "Total Input Tokens by Model",
      "description": "Total input tokens consumed per model over the selected window. Models with the highest input token count are receiving the most context — often indicating complex agent tasks or large codebase context. Source: gen_ai_client_token_usage_sum grouped by gen_ai_request_model filtered to input tokens.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 30},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "sort_desc(sum by (gen_ai_request_model) (increase(gen_ai_client_token_usage_sum{service_name=~\"$service\", gen_ai_token_type=\"input\", gen_ai_request_model=~\"$model\"}[$__range])))", "legendFormat": "{{gen_ai_request_model}}", "refId": "A", "instant": true}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "locale", "decimals": 0, "color": {"mode": "continuous-BlPu"}, "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}]}, "mappings": []}},
      "options": {"orientation": "horizontal", "displayMode": "gradient", "valueMode": "color", "namePlacement": "left", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "values": false}, "showUnfilled": true, "sizing": "auto", "minVizWidth": 8, "minVizHeight": 16, "maxVizHeight": 300},
      "transformations": []
    },
    {
      "id": 10, "type": "bargauge", "title": "Total Output Tokens by Model",
      "description": "Total output tokens generated per model over the selected window. Models with high output token counts are generating verbose responses. Compare input to output ratio — a high output-to-input ratio indicates the model is expanding content significantly.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 30},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "sort_desc(sum by (gen_ai_request_model) (increase(gen_ai_client_token_usage_sum{service_name=~\"$service\", gen_ai_token_type=\"output\", gen_ai_request_model=~\"$model\"}[$__range])))", "legendFormat": "{{gen_ai_request_model}}", "refId": "A", "instant": true}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "locale", "decimals": 0, "color": {"mode": "continuous-BlPu"}, "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}]}, "mappings": []}},
      "options": {"orientation": "horizontal", "displayMode": "gradient", "valueMode": "color", "namePlacement": "left", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "values": false}, "showUnfilled": true, "sizing": "auto", "minVizWidth": 8, "minVizHeight": 16, "maxVizHeight": 300},
      "transformations": []
    },
    {
      "id": 103, "type": "row", "title": "Model Efficiency",
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 40}, "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 11, "type": "bargauge", "title": "Average Tokens per Operation by Model",
      "description": "Average total tokens (input + output) per LLM operation for each model. Higher values mean each request to that model consumes more tokens. Use this to identify which models are being used for complex long-context tasks versus simple completions.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 41},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "sort_desc(sum by (gen_ai_request_model) (increase(gen_ai_client_token_usage_sum{service_name=~\"$service\", gen_ai_request_model=~\"$model\"}[$__range])) / clamp_min(sum by (gen_ai_request_model) (increase(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_count{service_name=~\"$service\", gen_ai_request_model=~\"$model\"}[$__range])), 1))", "legendFormat": "{{gen_ai_request_model}}", "refId": "A", "instant": true}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "locale", "decimals": 1, "color": {"mode": "continuous-BlPu"}, "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}]}, "mappings": []}},
      "options": {"orientation": "horizontal", "displayMode": "gradient", "valueMode": "color", "namePlacement": "left", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "values": false}, "showUnfilled": true, "sizing": "auto", "minVizWidth": 8, "minVizHeight": 16, "maxVizHeight": 300},
      "transformations": []
    },
    {
      "id": 12, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Token Consumption by Model Over Time",
      "description": "Daily token consumption per model. Shows how model adoption and usage is shifting over time. A growing line for a specific model indicates increasing developer preference or policy-driven adoption.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 41},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "sum by (gen_ai_request_model) (increase(gen_ai_client_token_usage_sum{service_name=~\"$service\", gen_ai_request_model=~\"$model\"}[1d]))", "legendFormat": "{{gen_ai_request_model}}", "refId": "A"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "locale", "custom": {"fillOpacity": 75, "lineWidth": 2}}},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom"}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}}
    }
  ],
  "links": [
    {"title": "MCP Tool Analytics", "url": "/d/copilot-otel-mcp-tools", "type": "link", "targetBlank": false},
    {"title": "Agent Performance", "url": "/d/copilot-otel-agent-performance", "type": "link", "targetBlank": false},
    {"title": "Code Survival", "url": "/d/copilot-otel-code-survival", "type": "link", "targetBlank": false},
    {"title": "Enterprise Overview", "url": "/d/copilot-enterprise-overview", "type": "link", "targetBlank": false}
  ]
}
